      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来气槽似乎在处理学生会的工作。\n她担任副会长，\n应该很多事要忙吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "293a3d65c0cdb065ac0b88c21647ba774e81fefd612643031bd3ec0c0facfe96",
